  "body": [
    "Congrats! You found our not-so-secret page for contacts promo codes, coupons, and discounts (as if our prices weren’t low enough to begin with). Go nuts with these contact lens discounts.",
    "First time? Not only will your contacts be more affordable than getting them from your eye care provider, but you’ll also save 30%. Plus, free shipping, exchanges, and a whole lotta eyeball love. Welcome!",
    "Yep. That’s a fine Acuvue Oasys discount right there. Plus, there’s no limit. It’s auto-applied at checkout so no offer code needed. Ready? Go.",
    "Eligible students, get 30% off your first order of contacts and fast, free shipping. Verify your eligibility and unlock your discount in less than five minutes.",
    "Add two boxes to your cart as a first-time AquaSoft Daily buyer and $25 will be auto-discounted at checkout. Super simple. Just like ordering from us.",
    "When you get to your cart and it says, “Have a promo code?” you can answer with a resounding, “Yes I do, website!” Then use the contacts offer code DEAL10 to save $10 off $100+. Promo not stackable with other offers or discounts. Only eligible for returning customers.",
    "Use your vision insurance benefits to lower the cost of your contact lenses, glasses, or an online vision exam. Look up my benefits.",
    "Contacts, glasses, and online vision exams are all eligible expenses. Simply use your FSA or HSA card at checkout.",
    "Many brands we carry come with after-purchase rebate savings. The larger supply you buy, the larger your savings.",
    "If eligible, renew your prescription with our online vision exam and you may qualify for less expensive brands.",
    "Free shipping for contact lenses",
    "Learn how to get free shipping, how long it takes for your contacts to arrive, and how to save time and money on the entire process.",
    "Read more",
    "What to do if your vision insurance doesn’t fully cover contacts",
    "A step-by-step guide on what to do if contacts aren’t covered or are only partially covered. Get resources and tips for keeping costs low.",
    "Read more",
    "Best affordable colored contacts",
    "What are the most affordable colored contacts, and how can you get them? Find colored lenses in your prescription and get a great new look.",
    "Read more",
    "Something didn’t work out with your contacts? Wanting to try a new brand and don’t want your current contacts to go to waste? Get free returns or exchanges on all unopened contacts.",
    "“Easy ordering, quick delivery, and not all those added fees and costs that other sites charge at check-out. The price you see is what you pay.”",
